  "details": "Allows you to talk to someone on your friends list while they are in another world or instance.\n\nThis could be useful if you cannot join their world or instance for whatever reason, but still want to say something or talk to them.\n\nYou should be able to do this from the client or the website, and it should be not restricted depending on which browser or platform you are signed in with the browser.\n\nThis will allow you to say something to your friends while you are not able not able to go into VRChat or not able to join the world or instance for any reason.\n\nThe way you would get to it is this route I came up with\n\nOpen menu (Expand it)\n\nClick social\n\nNow there will be a new tab above your favorite lists that says \"Chats\".\n\nHowever, on the website there will be a whole new button nn the side menu that says \"Chats\".",
